; Spec section 6.12: an access whose address is not a multiple of its width
; is a runtime error, before the device sees it: a region from 0x09000001
; puts every 2-byte access at an odd address, though offset 0 is in range.

(def main () int
  (let u (region_open 150994945 16)
    (let a (region_read8 u 0)
      (region_write16 u 0 0))))
